{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls/2275","id":4585237908,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABEU0tlA","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/2275","diff_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/2275.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/2275.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2275","number":2275,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix required-check deadlock in automated releases","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- explicitly dispatch the existing release workflow in a non-publishing `validate-pr` mode for release pull requests created with `GITHUB_TOKEN`\n- wait for that exact validation run to succeed before attempting the ruleset-protected merge, and abort without merging when validation fails\n- preserve least privilege with job-scoped `actions: write`, keep validation preflight in report mode, and cover both automatic and instant release paths through the shared landing helper\n- add a failing-first regression, update all four CI/CD best-practice translations, and include the required patch changeset\n\n## Root cause and reproduction\n\nAt 2026-09-20 04:28:10 UTC, the main ruleset began strictly requiring `Pipeline Status`. The existing fallback opened its release PR with `GITHUB_TOKEN`; GitHub left the ordinary `pull_request` workflows in `action_required`, so no `Pipeline Status` check was ever created. Ten merge retries could only repeat the invariant policy failure.\n\nThis reproduced in four consecutive main runs, creating release PRs #2268, #2272, #2273, and #2276. All twelve workflows attached to those PRs are `action_required`.\n\nBefore this change:\n\n1. direct version push is rejected by the ruleset\n2. fallback release PR is created\n3. required check never starts\n4. all merge attempts fail with `Required status check \"Pipeline Status\" is expected`\n\nAfter this change, the fallback dispatches `release.yml` on the generated head with `release_mode=validate-pr`, watches the returned run with `--exit-status`, and reaches merge only after successful validation. Publication jobs remain restricted to a push on `main` or explicit `instant` mode.\n\n## Verification\n\n- final evidence head `63f2f24f` — [Checks and release](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529722059), [Security](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529721830), [Workflows](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529721877), and [Broken Link Checker](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529721810) all passed\n- implementation candidate `1e1de488` — all four workflows passed, including full Docker/container validation; its complete logs are archived in the evidence bundle\n- `npm test` — all 495 selected test files passed\n- `node scripts/run-tests.mjs --suite github-integration` — selected integration file passed, 4/4 assertions\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm run format:check`\n- `npm run check:duplication`\n- `npm run check:secrets`\n- `node tests/extracted-modules-2198.test.mjs`\n- `bash scripts/check-file-line-limits.sh` — `release.yml` is 1,348 lines\n- issue #2274 regression verifies validation-before-merge and proves failed validation never calls merge\n\n## Evidence and related project\n\nThe complete investigation is archived in [`dev/log/issues/2274/pulls/2275`](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/tree/issue-2274-beb53fa7caf4/dev/log/issues/2274/pulls/2275), including the timeline, every requirement, root-cause/solution matrix, eight full CI logs, ruleset version history, annotation audit, template file/checksum comparison, local test logs, and primary-source research.\n\nThe same defect exists in the upstream JavaScript CI/CD template and is reported with reproductions, workarounds, and a code-level fix plan in link-foundation/js-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template#192.\n\nFixes #2274\n","created_at":"2026-09-20T17:39:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T18:53:17Z","closed_at":"2026-09-20T18:53:15Z","merged_at":"2026-09-20T18:53:15Z","merge_commit_sha":"26fef4165187a0a111279999f3a991c51d8f0609","assignees":[{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_adm